1
00:04:57,142 --> 00:05:03,142
Fake Cops. Real Trouble.

2
00:09:54,285 --> 00:10:00,285
Let's Be Cops is a comedy film directed by Luke Greenfield.

3
00:14:51,428 --> 00:14:57,428
Best pals Ryan and Justin are stalled in their respective careers -- a fact
that is painfully driven home when they go to a college reunion.

4
00:19:48,571 --> 00:19:54,571
Dressed as police in the mistaken belief that they were to attend a costume party, Ryan
and Justin find that the uniforms earn them much respect and attention.

5
00:24:45,714 --> 00:24:51,714
Although Justin is uncomfortable with the idea, Ryan decides to continue with the
charade, putting them both in increasingly dangerous situations.

6
00:29:42,857 --> 00:29:48,857
When these newly-minted “heroes” get tangled in a real life web of mobsters and
dirty detectives, they must put their fake badges on the line.

7
