13
01:04:22,857 --> 01:04:28,857
Let's Be Cops is a 2014 American buddy cop action comedy film
co-written and directed by Luke Greenfield.

14
01:09:20,000 --> 01:09:26,000
The film stars Damon Wayans Jr.

15
01:14:17,142 --> 01:14:23,142
and Jake Johnson as two friends who pretend to be
police officers in Los Angeles.

16
01:19:14,285 --> 01:19:20,285
The film co-starred Nina Dobrev, Rob Riggle, James D'Arcy, and Andy García.

17
01:24:11,428 --> 01:24:17,428
It was filmed on location in Atlanta, Georgia, and released on August 13, 2014.

18
01:29:08,571 --> 01:29:14,571
It received negative reviews from critics and grossed $138.2 million
worldwide against a production budget of $17 million.

19
01:34:05,714 --> 01:34:11,714
The film explores themes of robbery, corruption, police, kidnapping, nightclub.

20
01:39:02,857 --> 01:39:08,857
The tone is lighthearted.
